---
title: Corned Beef Dinner
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Casseroles
cook time: 1 hour 15 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@chopped corned beef{1%12-oz can}
@macaroni{1%6-oz pkg}
@cream of chicken soup{1%can}
@Velveeta, cubed{0.25%lb}
@chopped onion{0.5%cup}
@bread crumbs{0.75%cup}

Cook macaroni, rinse and drain. Combine with the rest of the ingredients except crumbs. Bake for 1 hour at 375 degrees. Add crumbs on top during last 15 minutes of baking.
